Disc Neo data pack: licence notice
==================================

Everything in this folder is licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version. SPDX identifier:
GPL-3.0-or-later. That covers the texture atlas data (atlas/), the CSV
indexes, the documentation, and the texture cards (texture-cards/: PDFs, data,
scripts, research inputs and checks). The full licence text follows below.

For this data, the "preferred form of the work for making modifications" is the
JSON and CSV files shipped here, together with the programs that produced them
in the disc-probe repository (tools/build_neo.py, the texture atlas under
evidence/atlas/, and docs/texture-cards/scripts/). PROVENANCE.json records the
exact versions and file hashes.

If you redistribute this data or something built from it, keep this notice and
the licence, and offer your changes under the same terms.

The colours in this pack are model predictions and have not been checked
against photographs. There is NO WARRANTY: see sections 15 and 16 below.

